          "prompt": "CPython 3.12.13: run source, then call. What returns/raises (exact types/value/order)?\n\ndef f(x):\n a=[[1,2],[3,4]]\n b=a[:]\n a[0].append(x)\n a[1]=[5]\n return b\n\nCall:\nf(*[9], **{})",
